Third-party software
--------------------

This source repository contains no third-party source code. Dependencies are
declared with exact versions in Cargo.lock and package-lock.json and are
downloaded at build time.

The built frontend bundles, among others:
- elkjs (graph layout), Eclipse Public License 2.0; source:
  https://github.com/kieler/elkjs
- Inter, JetBrains Mono and Noto Sans SC fonts, SIL Open Font License 1.1; the license texts
  ship in the built frontend under licenses/.

Anyone redistributing a build (for example a Docker image) should include the
licenses of its dependencies. `node scripts/release/build-candidate.mjs` builds a
package with an SBOM (sbom/) and every dependency license text (licenses/,
docs/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md).
